	(text "SLOT CONNECTOR PINOUT: 1 VIN_BUS (power contact furthest from signal pins), 2 GND (power contact between pin 1 and the signals), 3 CANH, 4 CANL. Preserve the prototype PCB connector footprints and 19 mm slot spacing; verify mating-view continuity before fabrication."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 115 0)
		(effects
			(font
